OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fahead with plenty of clear spells.
OL,7,FTemperatures will fall sharply
OL,8,Fovernight, beneath long clear spells
OL,9,Fas winds ease. A widespread frost is
OL,10,Fexpected, particularly in sheltered
OL,11,Fvalleys.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA frosty, sunny morning, then
OL,14,Fbecoming increasingly cloudy with a
OL,15,Ffew scattered showers during the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Feeling chilly, though only
OL,17,Fa light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
