OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Saturday with showers continuing,
OL,7,Ffocused over Cumbria, and a brisk,
OL,8,Fcold coastal breeze at times. Spells
OL,9,Fof rain and brightness on Sunday, then
OL,10,Fbrighter and drier on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
